message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SLR-Automate: An open-source pipeline for automated systematic literature reviews"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-15"
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Khan
    given-names: Owais
    email: owaiscs@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/owaiscs9985/slr-automate"
keywords:
  - systematic literature review
  - PRISMA
  - open science
  - research software
  - bibliometrics
abstract: >
  SLR-Automate is an open-source Python pipeline that automates key stages
  of the systematic literature review workflow: structured query
  construction, multi-source searching across open-access databases,
  cross-source deduplication, keyword-based screening, BibTeX enrichment,
  and PRISMA 2020 flow diagram generation.
